
IMAPStore mike@padiernos.me-remote
Host mail.padiernos.me
Port 993
User mike@padiernos.me
PassCmd "PASSWORD_STORE_DIR=\"$HOME/.pass\" pass mail/mike@padiernos.me | sed -n '1p'"
AuthMechs LOGIN
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

MaildirStore mike@padiernos.me-local
Subfolders Verbatim
Path /home/mikepadiernos/Library/.library/.maildir/mike@padiernos.me/
Inbox /home/mikepadiernos/Library/.library/.maildir/mike@padiernos.me/INBOX

Channel mike@padiernos.me
Expunge Both
Far :mike@padiernos.me-remote:
Near :mike@padiernos.me-local:
Patterns * !"[Gmail]/All Mail"
Create Both
SyncState *
MaxMessages 0
ExpireUnread no
# PipelineDepth 1
# End profile


