IMAPStore mike.padiernos@outlook.com-remote
Host imap-mail.outlook.com
Port 993
User mike.padiernos@outlook.com
PassCmd "sh -c '. \"$HOME/.config/mbsync/outlook-oauth.env\" 2>/dev/null; python3 \"$HOME/.files/.mbsync/mutt_oauth2.py\" \"$HOME/.config/mbsync/mike.padiernos@outlook.com.oauth2.token\"'"
AuthMechs XOAUTH2
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

MaildirStore mike.padiernos@outlook.com-local
Subfolders Verbatim
Path /home/mikepadiernos/Library/.library/.maildir/mike.padiernos@outlook.com/
Inbox /home/mikepadiernos/Library/.library/.maildir/mike.padiernos@outlook.com/INBOX

Channel mike.padiernos@outlook.com
Expunge Both
Far :mike.padiernos@outlook.com-remote:
Near :mike.padiernos@outlook.com-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
SyncState *
MaxMessages 0
ExpireUnread no
# End profile



